{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"At the playground, two children want the same red scooter.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.23,0.3],[0.37,1.11],[1.16,1.38],[1.46,1.93],[2,2.24],[2.29,2.36],[2.42,2.68],[2.74,2.94],[3,3.9]]},{"text":"Both hold the handle and frown.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.73],[0.78,0.85],[0.92,1.3],[1.36,1.5],[1.6,2.46]]},{"text":"Teacher Maya says, Let's make a turn plan.","words":[[0,0.43],[0.51,0.82],[0.89,1.41],[1.54,1.82],[1.88,2.07],[2.09,2.11],[2.17,2.44],[2.51,3.25]]},{"text":"She sets a one-minute timer for each rider.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.26,0.5],[0.56,0.58],[0.69,1.25],[1.3,1.71],[1.78,1.92],[2,2.21],[2.29,3.06]]},{"text":"First, Imani rides while Ravi waits by the cone.","words":[[0,0.73],[0.97,1.42],[1.49,1.86],[1.92,2.18],[2.24,2.53],[2.6,2.9],[2.96,3.1],[3.16,3.23],[3.3,4.13]]},{"text":"When the timer beeps, Imani returns the scooter and smiles.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.38],[0.44,0.8],[0.88,1.36],[1.38,1.81],[1.88,2.35],[2.39,2.46],[2.51,2.96],[3.03,3.15],[3.22,4.23]]},{"text":"Now Ravi rides his turn.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.36,0.66],[0.73,1.02],[1.07,1.22],[1.29,1.95]]},{"text":"The children discover waiting feels easier when the rules are clear.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.3,0.8],[0.87,1.49],[1.57,1.94],[2.01,2.3],[2.38,2.8],[2.88,3.08],[3.12,3.19],[3.26,3.61],[3.67,3.83],[3.9,4.74]]},{"text":"Later they even share helmets and cheer for each other.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.48,0.65],[0.73,0.96],[1.03,1.35],[1.42,1.92],[1.97,2.11],[2.18,2.46],[2.54,2.71],[2.77,2.97],[3.04,3.76]]},{"text":"They learn fair turns make play longer and happier for everyone.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.34,0.61],[0.71,0.97],[1.06,1.52],[1.61,1.87],[1.93,2.19],[2.29,2.71],[2.79,2.91],[3,3.38],[3.46,3.62],[3.7,4.69]]}]}